  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fundraising Action &apos;Geef Oekra&#xef;ners een Shelterbag tegen de Kou&apos;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Houses shot to pieces, sub-zero temperatures, no electricity and no heating due to bombing of power stations. Many residents of Ukraine have to survive in the freezing cold (for example in metro stations or shelters). Give heat! With 100 euros you give a Shelterbag from Sheltersuit: a tent, mattress and sleeping bag in one. Cordaid ensures that the worst affected people in the war zone at least get a warm place to sleep. Even smaller donations make a difference. Any amount is welcome.</narrative>
  </description>
